WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Here with his reaction is Stephen Miller, White House deputy chief of staff for policy.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.760
Stephen, you heard Tammy Duckworth's Gestapo comment, her zip-tie comment, which is like

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:16.760
– this reminds me of the patter around January 6th, it's the same thing, the gallows and

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:19.680
zip-ties, you know, all of that.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.520
Your reaction – let's just start with her comment, then we'll back into what Pritzker

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.520
and Johnson said.

